	(text "- 5 nodes, top face, look up at the bin above\n- Per node: TSOP38238 on 3V3, 100R + 4.7 uF (0805 / 10 V) on Vs, 100R series out\n- Footprint shared with TSSP40xx if the pinout matches (verify)\n- Own row -> local ESP32 GPIO AND -> J2 UP to the board above (Option B bin-owner read)\n- Row from the board below arrives on J3 DOWN: 10k pull-up, 100R, ESD at connector\n- Node 1: TP OUT, TP Vs + GND"
